OL,3,AOpenAI agents hijacked German website
OL,4,Abefore Hugging Face hack, report claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI said it could not "meaningfully
OL,7,Frespond" to Nightingale Collective's
OL,8,Ffindings because it hadn't been allowed
OL,9,Fto review the report, which was first
OL,10,Fshared with news agency Reuters.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
