OL,3,ABBC News presenter reveals she has
OL,4,Ablood cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm going to have to spend the rest of
OL,7,Fmy life being treated for this," she
OL,8,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
