SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788760523
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAndrew Scott feels the Pressure as
OL,4,A'unsung hero' in WW2 thriller
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He appeared to me to be an
OL,7,Fextraordinarily interesting cinematic
OL,8,Fcharacter, as well as an unsung hero
OL,9,Ffrom history."
OL,11,FStagg played a crucial advisory role
OL,12,Fwhen US General Dwight D Eisenhower
OL,13,Finvaded Normandy, laying the
OL,14,Ffoundations for the Allied victory in
OL,15,FWorld War Two.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
