OL,3,AWhy Munya Chawawa is 'jumping ship'
OL,4,Afrom socials to Shakespeare
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian, content creator and
OL,7,Fdocumentary maker Munya Chawawa became
OL,8,Fa star in the "golden era" of online
OL,9,Fvideo, but says his stage acting debut
OL,10,Fin Shakespeare is part of a move to
OL,11,F"jump ship" from social media.
OL,13,FRecently, he has been immersing himself
OL,14,Fin footage of the UK's 1990s illegal
OL,15,Frave scene.
OL,17,FIt was a time of hedonism and freedom
OL,18,Fsurrounded by political and media panic
OL,19,F- and is the setting for a modern take
OL,20,Fon Shakespeare's A Midsummer Night's
OL,21,FDream, in which Chawawa will appear.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
